{"id":"n92489-1-6","stage":4,"title":"오만 · 傲慢","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n92489-1-6-1","ko":"저번에 본 시험은 어떻게 됐어? 잘 봤다면서.","zh":"上次的那次考试怎么样了？听说你考得不错吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저번에","meaning":"那次","explanation":"저번：那次；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"저번","audio":"/audio/cfbadf011c981e92e9cc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71227","senseId":"1","lemma":"저번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"본","meaning":"考，参加","explanation":"보다：考，参加；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"12","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"시험은","meaning":"考试","explanation":"시험：考试；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"시험","audio":"/audio/ff65dc582ce71198934b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20233","senseId":"1","lemma":"시험","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"됐어?","meaning":"变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）","explanation":"되다：变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"13","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘","meaning":"很好地，了不起地","explanation":"잘：很好地，了不起地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"8","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"봤다면서.","meaning":"考，参加","explanation":"보다：考，参加；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다면서：引用所听到的话，向对方确认，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"12","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"cfbadf011c981e92","term":"저번","zh":"那次","audio":"/audio/cfbadf011c981e92e9cc.mp3","entryId":"71227","definition":"说话时刻之前已经过去的顺序或时间。","pronunciation":["저ː번"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"考，参加","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"为了鉴定知识水平或能力而进行考试。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"ff65dc582ce71198","term":"시험","zh":"考试","audio":"/audio/ff65dc582ce71198934b.mp3","entryId":"20233","definition":"按照问题、提问、实际行动等一定程序考核考生的知识或能力的事宜。","pronunciation":["시험"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"很好地，了不起地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"非常好地、优秀地，值得称赞地。","pronunciation":["잘"]}],"audio":"/audio/815e2931b676fcad3298.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n92489-1-6-2","ko":"잘 보기는. 그때의 생각은 내 오만이었어.","zh":"哪有考得好。我当时的想法只是自大罢了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"잘","meaning":"很好地，了不起地","explanation":"잘：很好地，了不起地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"8","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보기는.","meaning":"考，参加","explanation":"보다：考，参加；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"12","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그때의","meaning":"那时，那时候","explanation":"그때：那时，那时候；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"그때","audio":"/audio/2d0b6f3e4d1966c49aa8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29683","senseId":"1","lemma":"그때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"생각은","meaning":"念头，想法","explanation":"생각：念头，想法；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"생각","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58162","senseId":"3","lemma":"생각","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"내","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오만이었어.","meaning":"傲慢","explanation":"오만：傲慢；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"오만","audio":"/audio/f698713f45091726685f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"92489","senseId":"1","lemma":"오만","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"很好地，了不起地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"非常好地、优秀地，值得称赞地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"考，参加","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"为了鉴定知识水平或能力而进行考试。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"2d0b6f3e4d1966c4","term":"그때","zh":"那时，那时候","audio":"/audio/2d0b6f3e4d1966c49aa8.mp3","entryId":"29683","definition":"前面所说的某一时间。","pronunciation":["그때"]},{"id":"6ac12a8f8e4e4c22","term":"생각","zh":"念头，想法","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3","entryId":"58162","definition":"想做某事的心理或关注；或指那样的事。","pronunciation":["생각"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"f698713f45091726","term":"오만","zh":"傲慢","audio":"/audio/f698713f45091726685f.mp3","entryId":"92489","definition":"自以为是，傲慢无礼；或指那样的态度或行动。","pronunciation":["오ː만"]}],"audio":"/audio/ab6e2aaf99d0b61d92ff.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.86,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=92489","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":138,"sequenceScore":2.6867,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["哪有考得好。我当时的想法只是自大罢了。","上次的那次考试怎么样了？听说你考得不错吧？","网络上的民意调查结果根本不可信。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["上次的那次考试怎么样了？听说你考得不错吧？","网络上的民意调查结果根本不可信。","哪有考得好。我当时的想法只是自大罢了。"],"answer":2}]}
